'''Santa Kuu''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[Xmas Gals (Gacha Event)|Xmas Gals]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]] and is an [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel]]/[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Kuu (Uber Rare Cat)|Kuu]].

